  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Breaking: parsed EPP dates (DomainRenewResponse.ExDate and the Nominet dates) are now returned in UTC (DateTimeKind.Utc) as RFC 5730-5733 require, instead of being converted to the machine's local time. Values without a zone designator are taken as UTC. Fixes DomainRenew sending the wrong curExpDate east of UTC when given a full date-time, and a culture-dependent Smallregistry birthDate.",
